{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Awakening</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake in an unfamiliar place. The sky is heavy and grey, the ground soaked, and the roar of the ocean echoes behind you. Rising to your feet, you notice a dark figure ahead, a red lantern swaying in its grasp. It is no man, more bone than flesh , yet it does not strike you as hostile. As you draw closer, the figure offers you the souls of the damned. Spirits to be reanimated and bound to your will. These lost souls are granted one final chance to fight, redeem themselves, and escape this forsaken place, forever lashed by unending rain and wind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022710/extras/98be14f757636f352fd5eba651d7447e.webp?t=1762231659\" width=600 height=56 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shadows of Thornkeep</i> is a dark fantasy dungeon crawler where you guide a band of lost souls on expeditions across a mysterious island. Featuring grid-based exploration and turn-based combat, the game blends rogue-lite elements with traditional dungeon crawling. Death is not permanent \u2014 your heroes have already fallen once \u2014 but preparing them for the next journey always comes at a cost. Manage your party and camp, gather loot, and face relentless horrors, all brought to life in handcrafted pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022710/extras/b1eec0c7a20709e88e384b0c613d16a4.poster.avif?t=1762231659\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022710/extras/b1eec0c7a20709e88e384b0c613d16a4.webm?t=1762231659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022710/extras/b1eec0c7a20709e88e384b0c613d16a4.mp4?t=1762231659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grid-based dungeon crawling</strong> \u2013 explore twisted halls and cursed landscapes in classic step by step fashion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based combat</strong> \u2013 command your party in tactical battles where every action matters, no real time nonsense sidesteping around monsters to avoid beign hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue-lite elements</strong> \u2013 death is not the end, but revival comes with a price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party &amp; camp management</strong> \u2013 prepare your lost souls, tend to their needs, and keep them fit for the next expedition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot-centric progression</strong> \u2013 discover powerful gear, cursed relics, and resources to survive the island\u2019s trials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted pixel art</strong> \u2013 dark atmosphere brought to life with detailed, pixel by pixel crafted sprites.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Purge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022710/6e24f31ecf7c6b78acdbfd3c14c17331716a8095.jpg"},{"name":"Patrol","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022710/9f4ccfff64bca1f15a94dd287fe7b0dfa7ee427a.jpg"},{"name":"Hearth of Evil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022710/cc17150153e1534845f4f6fefa706c9b98803e57.jpg"},{"name":"Dungeon Delve","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022710/8d10dd61aae1bf2cd05c2a68e6808d3f53ad2211.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022710/6b9d399b6ed9075d675c6bb5386efbdb08dae319.jpg"},{"name":"Journeyman Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022710/12b12d3fbe6a7038bb9972694cfb5f5685f0640d.jpg"},{"name":"Adept Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022710/a5be295e7be653650772b50881860fdf9df6aa32.jpg"},{"name":"Master Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022710/444b3e7c6f1958db85b457cd007612e01b31ddae.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022710/038101e317750068edff6c24c989db8b7d1ff560.jpg"},{"name":"Cold Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022710/6e997c7d6ab77b343d5caf4b7e71393d7f1e27d7.jpg"}],"total":36},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022710?t=1762231659","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022710/0a1e9ca8698a9696a5d880d77e67bb71259bbfaf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762231659","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022710/b62bb96aa7a665152ff260d6f083ef24fb354f02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762231659","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022710/b62bb96aa7a665152ff260d6f083ef24fb354f02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762231659","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Awakening</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake in an unfamiliar place. The sky is heavy and grey, the ground soaked, and the roar of the ocean echoes behind you. Rising to your feet, you notice a dark figure ahead, a red lantern swaying in its grasp. It is no man, more bone than flesh , yet it does not strike you as hostile. As you draw closer, the figure offers you the souls of the damned. Spirits to be reanimated and bound to your will. These lost souls are granted one final chance to fight, redeem themselves, and escape this forsaken place, forever lashed by unending rain and wind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022710/extras/98be14f757636f352fd5eba651d7447e.webp?t=1762231659\" width=600 height=56 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shadows of Thornkeep</i> is a dark fantasy dungeon crawler where you guide a band of lost souls on expeditions across a mysterious island. Featuring grid-based exploration and turn-based combat, the game blends rogue-lite elements with traditional dungeon crawling. Death is not permanent \u2014 your heroes have already fallen once \u2014 but preparing them for the next journey always comes at a cost. Manage your party and camp, gather loot, and face relentless horrors, all brought to life in handcrafted pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022710/extras/b1eec0c7a20709e88e384b0c613d16a4.poster.avif?t=1762231659\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022710/extras/b1eec0c7a20709e88e384b0c613d16a4.webm?t=1762231659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022710/extras/b1eec0c7a20709e88e384b0c613d16a4.mp4?t=1762231659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grid-based dungeon crawling</strong> \u2013 explore twisted halls and cursed landscapes in classic step by step fashion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based combat</strong> \u2013 command your party in tactical battles where every action matters, no real time nonsense sidesteping around monsters to avoid beign hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue-lite elements</strong> \u2013 death is not the end, but revival comes with a price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party &amp; camp management</strong> \u2013 prepare your lost souls, tend to their needs, and keep them fit for the next expedition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot-centric progression</strong> \u2013 discover powerful gear, cursed relics, and resources to survive the island\u2019s trials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted pixel art</strong> \u2013 dark atmosphere brought to life with detailed, pixel by pixel crafted sprites.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Tryzna83"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022710/0243ae0610197a40960921672af02f5ce1fb9d7c/header.jpg?t=1762231659","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022710/1550151798/5280f9ddbdba0e225b7ae7869102420ea60f4069/1757475205/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758822943","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022710/1550151798/5280f9ddbdba0e225b7ae7869102420ea60f4069/1757475205/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758822943","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022710/1550151798/5280f9ddbdba0e225b7ae7869102420ea60f4069/1757475205/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758822943","id":257195451,"name":"Thornkeep EA trailer",